# ABP CLI

## Common Commands

### Create New Solution
```bash
abp new BookStore -t app -u blazor -d ef
```

Options:
- `-t`: Template (app, app-nolayers, module, console)
- `-u`: UI framework (mvc, blazor, blazor-server, angular, none)
- `-d`: Database provider (ef, mongo)
- `--tiered`: Create tiered solution
- `-o`: Output folder

### Add Package
```bash
abp add-package Volo.Abp.Caching.StackExchangeRedis
```

### Add Module
```bash
abp add-module Volo.Abp.BlobStoring
```

### Generate Proxy
```bash
abp generate-proxy -t csharp -u https://localhost:44300
abp generate-proxy -t ng -m identity
```

### Database Migrations
```bash
abp dbmigrator
```

### Install Libraries
```bash
abp install-libs
```

### Update ABP
```bash
abp update
```

### Switch to Preview
```bash
abp switch-to-preview
abp switch-to-stable
```
